freedom focused,

00:02:27.013 --> 00:02:28.281
blah, blah, blah?

00:02:28.281 --> 00:02:30.016
Or was it a bit of
a pushback against

00:02:30.016 --> 00:02:32.018 align:start size:94% position:6%
