the last couple years?

00:02:32.018 --> 00:02:34.354
- Yeah, I wasn't
always this way.

00:02:34.354 --> 00:02:37.223
It been a bit of a pushback.

00:02:37.223 --> 00:02:39.959
I mean, look, just like
so many other people,

00:02:39.959 --> 00:02:43.830 align:start position:0%
and I'll admit it, I was
living in a bubble of ignorance

00:02:43.830 --> 00:02:46.366 align:start position:0%
and entitlement, just thinking,
well, this is America.

00:02:46.366 --> 00:02:49.269
Like, why you don't need
to worry about freedom?

00:02:49.269 --> 00:02:54.073 align:start size:84% position:16%
Like we can take it
for granted. Surprise.

00:02:54.073 --> 00:02:55.742 align:start size:84% position:16%
It turns out that's
not the case.

00:02:55.742 --> 00:02:58.912
And I don't like that I lived
in the bubble of ignorance,

00:02:58.912 --> 00:03:02.315
but I did until our freedom
started getting taken away.

00:03:02.315 --> 00:03:05.485
And you just see, if you
study patterns of history,

00:03:05.485 --> 00:03:08.788 align:start size:84% position:16%
you see where it could
go if we allow it.

00:03:08.788 --> 00:03:13.793 align:start size:97% position:3%
So that helped me realize
freedom's my number one value,

00:03:14.928 --> 00:03:18.531 align:start size:88% position:13%
everything great in
life depends on freedom.

00:03:18.531 --> 00:03:22.402 align:start size:88% position:13%
And, my child being able
to have a great life

00:03:22.402 --> 00:03:26.306
and his children one
day, they need freedom.

00:03:26.306 --> 00:03:31.311 align:start size:88% position:13%
So I used to just never
be in the politics,

00:03:32.679 --> 00:03:33.913 align:start size:97% position:3%
couldn't even tell you
what the difference between

00:03:33.913 --> 00:03:36.349
