00:03:36.349 --> 00:03:39.519
But looking back,
I could see, yeah,

00:03:39.519 --> 00:03:44.524 align:start size:97% position:3%
I leaned liberal and it was
kind of cool, but not anymore.

00:03:45.358 --> 00:03:46.726
I have freedom.

00:03:46.726 --> 00:03:48.394
(both laugh)

00:03:48.394 --> 00:03:52.031 align:start position:0%
- Yeah, well, we played a little
bit of the standup special

00:03:52.031 --> 00:03:53.433
as the cold open for the show,

00:03:53.433 --> 00:03:56.469 align:start position:0%
and I'm sure most of my
audience knows you from YouTube

00:03:56.469 --> 00:03:58.805
and Rumble and elsewhere.

00:03:58.805 --> 00:04:02.141
Are you surprised that
so many comics went woke?

00:04:02.141 --> 00:04:04.010
I mean, there are a ton
of guys I talk about

00:04:04.010 --> 00:04:07.213
on the show all the time, who
I used to love and admire,

00:04:07.213 --> 00:04:11.117 align:start size:97% position:3%
who were my comic influences,
some of them my friends

00:04:11.117 --> 00:04:14.487
who then just went
off the deep end

00:04:14.487 --> 00:04:16.956 align:start size:84% position:16%
with this woke,
politically correct,

00:04:16.956 --> 00:04:19.192 align:start size:81% position:19%
I mean, that's
the danger really.

00:04:19.192 --> 00:04:21.227
Not just woke, but
politically correct

00:04:21.227 --> 00:04:24.597
and language freezing stuff
that has led us to all this.

00:04:26.332 --> 00:04:29.569 align:start size:88% position:13%
- To be honest with you,
I have been surprised

00:04:29.569 --> 00:04:32.105 align:start size:84% position:16%
that so many comedians
have gone woke

00:04:32.105 --> 00:04:37.110
because, I think of a comedian
as sort of the rebel against

00:04:38.511 --> 00:04:41.281 align:start size:84% position:16%
the system, the
system of corruption.

00:04:41.281 --> 00:04:44.417 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think the most important
thing about comedy

00:04:44.417 --> 00:04:45.885
is the truth principle.

00:04:45.885 --> 00:04:50.123 align:start size:94% position:6%
So at its core, I consider
comedians to be people

00:04:50.123 --> 00:04:53.826
who represent truth and
they do it in a fun way

00:04:53.826 --> 00:04:56.963 align:start size:84% position:16%
and be goofy and
insane along the way.

00:04:56.963 --> 00:04:59.932
So, as you see a lot of
people in the country

00:04:59.932 --> 00:05:02.902 align:start size:97% position:3%
go woke, I would've
expected a lesser percentage

00:05:02.902 --> 00:05:04.837
of comedians to do that.

00:05:06.539 --> 00:05:09.075
I can understand why
they might, I mean

00:05:09.075 --> 00:05:13.813 align:start size:97% position:3%
I think if someone outsources
their power and success

00:05:13.813 --> 00:05:17.750 align:start size:88% position:13%
to other people,
whether it's a audience,

00:05:17.750 --> 00:05:22.622
a network or trying
to get picked up by
some kind of agency,

00:05:22.622 --> 00:05:27.627
I can see that that's my only
hypothesis why someone would

00:05:28.795 --> 00:05:32.031
abandon the truth
principle and cater

00:05:32.031 --> 00:05:34.567
to political correctness
when they're comedians.

00:05:34.567 --> 00:05:37.770
So I'm not totally sure,
but that's my hypothesis

00:05:37.770 --> 00:05:41.240
on why some haven't by
the way, and the ones

00:05:41.240 --> 00:05:44.277
who haven't, man, they're like,

00:05:44.277 --> 00:05:47.313
it's a great time for
business, for comedians

00:05:47.313 --> 00:05:51.017 align:start size:88% position:13%
