00:06:40.700 --> 00:06:42.301
He absolutely crushed it.

00:06:42.301 --> 00:06:43.136
(JP laughing)

00:06:43.136 --> 00:06:44.137
- That's hilarious.

00:06:45.705 --> 00:06:48.074
- So, okay, so the
title of the special

00:06:48.074 --> 00:06:49.575
is "Please Censor This!".

00:06:49.575 --> 00:06:52.278
And I thought that that
