of places where you could

00:07:07.460 --> 00:07:09.729
have done it, but
you did it with us.

00:07:09.729 --> 00:07:10.963
So I'm pretty happy about that.

00:07:10.963 --> 00:07:13.766
- Yeah, I thought about
all the possibilities

00:07:13.766 --> 00:07:15.067
and to be honest with you, Dave,

00:07:15.067 --> 00:07:18.671 align:start size:84% position:16%
