00:08:55.968 --> 00:08:59.472
And it's just been such
a joy to get this special

00:08:59.472 --> 00:09:02.675 align:start size:94% position:6%
out to the world, I
think in a beautiful way.

00:09:02.675 --> 00:09:04.977 align:start size:84% position:16%
If I did it completely
independently

00:09:04.977 --> 00:09:08.247
had some sort of weird
