00:09:22.528 --> 00:09:26.532
I love that aspect, that's
been such a great bonus.

00:09:26.532 --> 00:09:28.334 align:start size:84% position:16%
- Oh, well I'm
thrilled to hear that.

00:09:28.334 --> 00:09:29.535 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean, and that's exactly
what it's all about.

00:09:29.535 --> 00:09:31.604 align:start size:84% position:16%
We want people that
