00:09:52.925 --> 00:09:54.860
I have nothing to
do with it anymore.

00:09:54.860 --> 00:09:58.397
Are you like just completely
outta that world altogether?

00:09:58.397 --> 00:10:02.835
- Yeah, I would say
I'm very much removed

00:10:02.835 --> 00:10:05.004
from the Hollywood
world in the sense

00:10:05.004 --> 00:10:09.275
of I have nothing on
my bucket list that

00:10:09.275 --> 00:10:11.510
