it because it's independent.

00:10:22.722 --> 00:10:27.727
There's not some big woke
China backed BS, ESG entity

00:10:31.397 --> 00:10:34.467
behind it, so I'm,
I love creativity

00:10:34.467 --> 00:10:37.103
and I love what I stand for.

00:10:37.103 --> 00:10:40.072 align:start position:0%
So when there's value alignment,
I'm willing to consider,

00:10:40.072 --> 00:10:42.375 align:start size:88% position:13%
oh, an independent
film, things like that.

00:10:42.375 --> 00:10:45.511
But the beautiful thing
